      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772971746057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ Auth middleware\n2️⃣ Cart system\n3️⃣ Product service\n4️⃣ Order service\n5️⃣ Payment integration\n6️⃣ Admin role middleware\n7️⃣ Rate limiting\n8️⃣ Logging",
